window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I flirted with a dragon shifter at a wedding, and it accidentally started a magical, </b><b><i>miserable</i></b><b> mating process between us.</b></p> <p>It's technically my fault, but we're not focusing on that.</p> <p>Now, we have to figure out how to fight the magic pushing us together.</p> <p>Or… we have to embrace the bond.</p> <p>But neither of us knows a thing about relationships, so the odds of success?</p> <p>They're not looking great for us.</p> <p>I have to figure out what to do about the bond—and fast. Because the more time passes, the worse my pain is going to get…and the less control Jasper will have over his beastly side.</p> <p><b><i>This is a fun, steamy full-length standalone romance with a happily ever after!</i></b></p>"; 
